OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith some bright spells at first but
OL,7,Fpatchy rain soon spreading north
OL,8,Fthrough the evening, the rain turning
OL,9,Fheavier at times overnight.
OL,10,FStrengthening southerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy rain in the morning then dry for
OL,14,Fa time before further showers in the
OL,15,Fafternoon and evening. Fresh to strong
OL,16,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
