OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,6,Fstart Monday, then strong winds and
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping, this persisting through
OL,9,Fmuch of Tuesday. Strong winds easing
OL,10,Fearly Wednesday, dry with bright
OL,11,Fspells later.
